      "script": "document.body.style.cssText = 'margin:0; background: #0A0A0F; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; font-family: Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif;'; document.body.innerHTML = '<div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:800px\"><div style=\"font-size:36px; font-weight:700; color:#6366f1; margin-bottom:30px\">📍 Clip Placement Strategy</div><div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding:40px; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\"><div style=\"font-size:20px; color:#fff; line-height:2; text-align:left\">Standard 4×3 Frame: <span style=\"color:#22c55e; font-weight:700\">4 clips</span> (2 per long side)<br>Orientation: Grip backing plate from the back<br>Spacing: Max 40mm unsupported edge per clip<br><br>Larger collage frames → proportionally more clips<br><br><div style=\"margin-top:16px; padding:16px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.15); border-radius:8px; border-left:3px solid #22c55e\">💡 Position clips so users can easily press + release when swapping photos</div></div></div></div>';",
